  - text: The fire that burns for no one, therefore it can warm anyone,
    startTime: 6
    endTime: 12.1
  - text: And the human trying to find their inner light,
    startTime: 12.1
    endTime: 17
  - text: Are all part of the same garden, visitors and gardeners.
    startTime: 17
    endTime: 25
